         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two-Col-Content-Img",
         "name": "widget_1749724825893",
         "params": {
          "background_color": "#F0F5F6",
          "button": {
           "text_field": "Book a Demo"
          },
          "content": "<p>Flieber uses the most modern AI transformer models to forecast demand with precision\u2014factoring in promotions, stockouts, seasonality, and more. Its transformer architecture improves continuously as your business evolves. Foresight AI ( previously Inventoro ) relies on outdated statistical models with basic ML layers, often requiring manual tweaks and falling short in dynamic environments.</p>",
          "content_width": "470px",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading": "AI Demand forecasting tailored to modern commerce",
          "image_field": {
           "alt": "ai-demand",
           "height": 450,
